n <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\subseteq X\">\\(a\\subseteq X\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}(a)\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}(a)\\)</span> (finite subset witness)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb8FiniteCharacterFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb8FiniteCharacterFamily}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}finite\\text{-}character\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb8FiniteCharacterFamily}_S(\\mathcal{F})\\leftrightarrow \\forall X\\in V\\;\\Bigl(X\\in\\mathcal{F}\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\;(\\mathrm{Finite}(a)\\to a\\in\\mathcal{F})\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}finite\\text{-}character\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb8FiniteCharacterFamily}_S(\\mathcal{F})\\leftrightarrow \\forall X\\in V\\;\\Bigl(X\\in\\mathcal{F}\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\;(\\mathrm{Finite}(a)\\to a\\in\\mathcal{F})\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every set belongs exactly when all of its finite subsets, tested by the registered finiteness predicate, belong; the former <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[X]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\([X]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> metanotation has been eliminated.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{